  *
  * Flows come from nf_flowtable hardware offload (TC_SETUP_FT on the DSA conduit, which DSA user ports delegate to). As in mtk_ppe, a flow is only bound once the engine asks for it: on a table miss it builds an unbound entry at the hash index of the frame and, past the bind rate, delivers frames of that entry with CPU reason HIT_UNBIND_RATE_REACHED and the index in the RX descriptor. en75_ppe_check_skb() then reads the tuple back from that entry and binds the matching flow in place, so the software never has to reproduce the hardware hash.
  *
- * Scope: IPv4 TCP/UDP (NAPT or plain routing) between ports behind the MediaTek-tagged switch on GDM1, leaving through GDM1 directly (no QDMA forwarding queue). Everything else stays in software.
+ * Scope: IPv4 TCP/UDP (NAPT or plain routing) and IPv6 TCP/UDP routing (5-tuple entries, no address translation) between ports behind the MediaTek-tagged switch on GDM1, leaving through GDM1 directly (no QDMA forwarding queue), with up to two encapsulation layers on either side as nf_flowtable describes them (NF_FLOW_TABLE_ENCAP_MAX): one or two 802.1Q tags, a PPPoE session, or 802.1Q then PPPoE. Everything else stays in software.
+ *
+ * 封装（原厂 hw_nat PpeSetVlan/PpeFillInL2Info/PpeSetEntryBind 与 mainline mtk_foe_entry_set_dsa/vlan/pppoe 同义）：表项只描述出向二层，入向的 VLAN/PPPoE 不进表项，由硬件解析后剥掉、按出向字段重建。出向经交换机时 802.1Q 头与 MediaTek 标签合并：etype = BIT(端口) | (TPID 类型 << 8)，vlan1 = 第一层 TCI，ib1 的 VLAN 层数（含标签这一层）为 1；第二层 802.1Q 时 vlan2 = 内层 TCI、层数 2。PPPoE 置 ib1 bit19、会话号写进 L2 块，etype 仍是标签。IPv6 表项没有新地址字段（原厂 NAT66 走软件），带地址或端口改写的 IPv6 规则拒绝。
  */
 #include <linux/bitfield.h>
 #include <linux/device.h>
@@ -16,12 +18,17 @@
